      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "when the chocolate mixture is almost cold, put all together with the flavoring and stir until light",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in open shells of pastry",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "When done, cover with a meringue made of the whites of two eggs and two tablespoonfuls of sugar flavored with a teaspoonful of lemon juice",
